            "heading": "How do I recharge the toy and how long does it last?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The ball charges easily using the included Type-C USB cable. A quick charge provides hours of active play sessions for your feline friend.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_LBnmdE": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is the material safe and bite-resistant?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
